# Closed-loop runtime (pack gitignore snippet)
# Ignore per-run artifacts. Re-include the ledger — a directory ignore of
# `loop/` cannot be negated. See skills/closed-loop/gates.md (memory).
loop/*
!loop/learnings.md
!loop/learnings.jsonl
!loop/INDEX.md
.cursor/loop/handoffs/*.json
.cursor/loop/state.json
.claude/handoffs/*.json
